00:12:33.041 --> 00:12:37.375
Bringing value in other
areas you know like

00:12:37.375 --> 00:12:40.583
health and wellness
or vacation advice.

00:12:40.583 --> 00:12:45.083
Using content as a gateway drug
to the insurance product around

00:12:45.083 --> 00:12:49.041
the psychographics
of the person.

00:12:49.041 --> 00:12:50.208
- How much of your effort--

00:12:50.208 --> 00:12:51.417
- [DRock] You actually
haven't said that a lot.

00:12:51.417 --> 00:12:53.959
Psychographics of the
person you're trying to get.

00:12:53.959 --> 00:12:56.708
- Yeah. It's true.

00:12:56.708 --> 00:12:58.458
Means it's an important point.

00:12:58.458 --> 00:13:00.750
Sometimes I keep
stuff to the vest.

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:03.250
